  "mach:trainingDataSummary": "Extension of MedSAM training corpus to 3D volumetric and video medical data including CT volumes, MRI sequences, and clinical video (endoscopy, ultrasound).",
  "mach:intendedUse": "3D volumetric and video medical image segmentation for research workflows requiring instance tracking across slices or frames. Not a cleared medical device.",
